WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.994
devhost hands each service its port, its hostname, and your own variables.

00:05.444 --> 00:07.998
This service declares two variables of its own.

00:09.884 --> 00:10.999
Start the stack.

00:11.449 --> 00:14.560
devhost assigns a free port and starts the service.

00:15.010 --> 00:19.143
The service received its port, bind host, hostname, and your message.

00:20.810 --> 00:21.925
Stop the stack.
